    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115767" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψινάζει:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπορρεῖ τὰ ἀσθενῆ τοῦ καρποῦ, φυλλορρεῖ,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψεινάζει</span> Id.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψίναθος:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρία αἴξ,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψινάς</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθινάς</span>
			, in pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψινάδες: αἱ ῥυάδες
				ἄμπελοι,</span> Id.: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψίνω.</span></div>
